{%- comment -%}
  accordion.liquid — one disclosure row.

  Built on <details>/<summary> so it opens, is keyboard operable, and is
  announced correctly with no JavaScript at all. Callers loop this to build
  a group; there is no wrapper element here so a group can be laid out
  however the section needs.

  §9.6: the first item on a PDP is open by default, and shipping and returns
  are never more than one click away — pass `open: true` for the first row.

  Params:
    heading   (string, required)
    content   (string, required)  — may be rich text
    open      (boolean, optional) — default false
    id        (string, optional)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if heading != blank and content != blank -%}
  <details class="accordion__item" {% if open %}open{% endif %} {% if id != blank %}id="{{ id }}"{% endif %}>
    <summary class="accordion__summary">
      <span class="h6">{{ heading }}</span>
      {%- render 'icon', icon: 'chevron-down', class: 'accordion__icon', size: 18 -%}
    </summary>
    <div class="accordion__content rte">{{ content }}</div>
  </details>
{%- endif -%}
